      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sealed in the underground",
      "translation" : "封印在普隆德拉城堡"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 19,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "of the Prontera Castle...",
      "translation" : "地下深处..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 20,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I didn't expect it to be this huge...",
      "translation" : "没想到这里竟然这么大..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 23,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 24,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What on earth is there inside?",
      "translation" : "里面到底有什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 27,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 28,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't know. Let's investigate the inside, first.",
      "translation" : "不知道。我们先进去调查一下吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This...this must be...",
      "translation" : "这...这一定是..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ymir's Heart!",
      "translation" : "尤弥尔之心！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 101,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This...",
      "translation" : "这..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "This is Ymir's Heart...",
      "translation" : "这是尤弥尔之心..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Rumbling~",
      "translation" : "~轰隆隆~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 110,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Why is this place shaking?!",
      "translation" : "这里为什么在摇晃？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grunts~ They must've started attacking this place, too.",
      "translation" : "~闷哼~看来他们也开始攻击这里了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grins~ Delighted to see you all.",
      "translation" : "~咧嘴笑~见到你们真高兴。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 123,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 124,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "!!",
      "translation" : "！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 125,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You've got to be kidding me!",
      "translation" : "开什么玩笑！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 128,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 129,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "From this moment on, we the Immortal Legion by Lord Valkyrie Himelmez",
      "translation" : "从现在开始，隶属于女武神希梅尔兹大人的不死军团"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 130,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "will take over here.",
      "translation" : "将接管这里。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 134,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 135,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What? How dare you!",
      "translation" : "什么？你竟敢！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 136,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm game. Bring it on!",
      "translation" : "有本事就来吧！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 139,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 140,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grins~ Do I look like I have the time to deal with a petty thing like you, human?",
      "translation" : "~咧嘴笑~人类，你觉得我有时间对付你这种小角色吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 141,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But, out of pure mercy, I'll let you taste the fearful power of the Immortal Legion just a little bit.",
      "translation" : "不过，出于慈悲，我就让你稍微尝尝不死军团的可怕力量。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 144,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 145,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Grunts~ When did all the legionnaires get here?",
      "translation" : "~闷哼~这些军团士兵是什么时候来的？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 223,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 224,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Chuckles~ I think you're not that bad for a human.",
      "translation" : "~轻笑~作为人类，你还算不错。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 227,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 228,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "But do you think you can get away from this, again? Wake up, my underlings!",
      "translation" : "不过你觉得这次还能逃掉吗？醒来吧，我的部下！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 235,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 236,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What...what's up with this monster?!",
      "translation" : "这...这怪物是怎么回事？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 239,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 240,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ah...",
      "translation" : "啊..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 241,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll let you in on me before I go.",
      "translation" : "在我离开之前，就让你知道我的身份吧。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 242,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm Bijou.",
      "translation" : "我叫碧珠。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 243,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'm the adjutant to Lord Valkyrie Himelmez.",
      "translation" : "我是女武神希梅尔兹大人的副官。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 246,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 247,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 248,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "No Valkyrie's subordinates ever disappointed me and neither did you.",
      "translation" : "女武神的部下从没让我失望过，你也一样。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 249,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Ymir's Heart is a huge energy source. For what do you want to use it anyway?",
      "translation" : "尤弥尔之心蕴含着巨大的能量。你们到底想用它做什么？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 252,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 253,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 254,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You don't need to know. You're going to be wiped out soon anyway.",
      "translation" : "你不必知道。反正你们很快就会被消灭。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 257,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 258,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I don't think you'd use it for any good cause.",
      "translation" : "我不认为你们会把它用在正道上。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 259,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll stop Bijou from taking Ymir's Heart. You go ahead and take care of that huge monster!",
      "translation" : "我去阻止碧珠夺走尤弥尔之心。你去对付那只巨大的魔物！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 423,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 424,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Was that it...? Has it gone now?",
      "translation" : "结束了吗...？它已经消失了吗？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 425,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "So what's left now is...",
      "translation" : "那么现在剩下的就是..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 429,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 430,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Me...I'm the only one left...",
      "translation" : "我...只剩我一个了..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 433,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 434,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "What?!",
      "translation" : "什么？！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 436,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~POW!~",
      "translation" : "~砰！~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 440,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Iris]",
      "translation" : "[艾丽丝]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 441,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Aaarrghhh---!!!",
      "translation" : "啊啊啊---！！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 444,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 445,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I must say it was rather unexpected. ~Chuckles~",
      "translation" : "不得不说，这实在出乎我的意料。~轻笑~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 446,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I didn't expect anyone to defeat Amdarais that I spent three good years to complete.",
      "translation" : "我没想到有人能打败阿姆达莱斯，我可是花了整整三年才完成它。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 449,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 450,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You will pay",
      "translation" : "你要为此付出代价"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 451,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "for ruining my three-year efforts!!",
      "translation" : "竟敢毁掉我三年的心血！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 452,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Slowly...",
      "translation" : "慢慢地..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 453,
      "npc" : "Iris",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "And horribly painfully...!!",
      "translation" : "痛苦地死去...!!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 500,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 501,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~ I can't believe nothing seems to work!",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~真不敢相信，所有攻击似乎都没用！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 504,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 505,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Chuckles~",
      "translation" : "~轻笑~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 506,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I'll let you taste what despair feels like.",
      "translation" : "我会让你尝尝绝望的滋味。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 509,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 510,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Frost Diver!",
      "translation" : "冰冻术！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 516,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 517,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "~Groans~",
      "translation" : "~呻吟~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 520,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 521,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "How does it feel? Painful, eh?",
      "translation" : "感觉如何？很痛苦吧？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 522,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You must become paralyzed by now.",
      "translation" : "你现在一定已经麻痹了。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 523,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "...But don't expect me to kill you that easily...",
      "translation" : "...不过别以为我会这么轻易杀了你..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 525,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 526,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I should take care of this downright annoying cleric gal first.",
      "translation" : "我得先解决那个烦人的女祭司。"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 529,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Fenrir]",
      "translation" : "[芬里尔]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 530,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "I...Iris!!",
      "translation" : "艾...艾丽丝！！"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 533,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 534,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "......",
      "translation" : "..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 538,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 539,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "Sarah...?",
      "translation" : "莎拉...？"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 542,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
