      "line" : 581,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Bijou]",
      "translation" : "[碧珠]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 582,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "(~Scoffs~ What an uptight, pathetic Valkyrie she is! I can't believe a greenhorn like you are treated the same as Himelmez. That is so unfair.)",
      "translation" : "(~嗤笑~真是个死板又可悲的女武神！你这种乳臭未干的家伙竟然能和希梅尔兹大人平起平坐，太不公平了。)"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 585,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "[Sarah]",
      "translation" : "[莎拉]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 586,
      "npc" : "Fenrir",
      "state" : "translated",
      "text" : "You must be out of your mind, Bijou...There is no Himelmez here.",
